	<section_number>64.2-205</section_number>
	<catch_line>Right of entry or action for land not affected by descent cast</catch_line>
	<text>
		The right to make entry on or bring an action to recover land is not tolled or defeated by descent cast.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 64-10; 1968, c. 656, § 64.1-10; 2012, c. 614.</history>
</law>
